OL,3,GNEWSAMan on bail after allegedly
OL,4,Aspitting at MP statue
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man arrested after he allegedly spat
OL,7,Fat the statue of a murdered MP has been
OL,8,Freleased on bail.
OL,10,FEssex Police said it was informed on
OL,11,FWednesday about a video of the alleged
OL,12,Fincident, which had been posted on
OL,13,FTikTok.
OL,15,FThe statue of Sir David, the former
OL,16,FConservative MP for Southend West, was
OL,17,Funveiled near the Chalkwell Lifeguards
OL,18,Fbase at the seafront in April 2024.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
