OL,3,GNEWSAMan on bail after allegedly
OL,4,Aspitting at MP statue
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe suspect, aged in his 30s, was held
OL,7,Fon suspicion of a public order offence
OL,8,Fand criminal damage. A police
OL,9,Fspokesperson said he had been released
OL,10,Fon conditional bail until January.
